### Phase 7 — erpApi.js — New API Surface

New service file mirroring all ERP backend endpoints the app needs:

```javascript
// ERP Trips
fetchErpTrips(token, filters)           → GET /api/erp/trips
fetchDriverActiveTrip(token)            → GET /api/erp/trips/active  (*)
fetchErpTripById(token, tripId)         → GET /api/erp/trips/:tripId
closeErpTrip(token, tripId, payload)    → POST /api/erp/trips/:tripId/close

// Placements
fetchPlacements(token, filters)         → GET /api/erp/placements
fetchPlacementById(token, id)           → GET /api/erp/placements/:id

// Advances  
fetchAdvances(token, filters)           → GET /api/erp/advances
fetchDriverAdvance(token)               → GET /api/erp/advances/my-advance (*)

// Consignments (CNs)
fetchConsignments(token, filters)       → GET /api/erp/consignments
uploadBiltyDocument(token, file)        → POST /api/erp/consignments/upload-bilty (multipart)
submitConsignment(token, payload)       → POST /api/erp/consignments

// PODs
fetchPods(token, filters)               → GET /api/erp/pods
uploadPodDocument(token, file)          → POST /api/erp/pods/upload (multipart)
submitPod(token, payload)               → POST /api/erp/pods

// Delivery Orders
fetchDeliveryOrders(token, filters)     → GET /api/erp/delivery-orders

// Approvals
fetchApprovals(token, filters)          → GET /api/erp/approvals
decideApproval(token, id, decision)     → PATCH /api/erp/approvals/:id/decide

// Unloading
fetchUnloadings(token, filters)         → GET /api/erp/unloading
submitUnloading(token, payload)         → POST /api/erp/unloading

// Finance / Ledger / Khata
fetchFinanceSummary(token)              → GET /api/erp/finance
fetchLedgerEntries(token, filters)      → GET /api/erp/ledger
fetchKhataLedger(token, filters)        → GET /api/erp/khata
fetchSaleBills(token, filters)          → GET /api/erp/sale-bills
```

(*) Needs backend change to expose driver-scoped trip view.

