## 8. Verification Plan

### Per-Phase Testing
- Each new screen will be tested against the live backend (Docker Compose running locally).
- Role-based access tested by logging in with test accounts for each role.
- EAS Preview build rebuilt after each phase for physical device testing.

### Regression
- Existing driver + field agent flows (fuel log, repair log, documents, SOS) must pass end-to-end after every phase.

### UI Review
- Screenshots of each new screen to be shared with the team before moving to the next phase.

